{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"創世記","commonName":"創世記","title":"創世記","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"c386c509bcaf2d2e415b454ca78f5cfd89495b0f945d3896fb5dab5baca206b4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1532},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["人違背命令"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華上帝所造的，惟有蛇比田野一切的活物更狡猾。蛇對女人說：「上帝豈是真說不許你們吃園中所有樹上的果子嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["女人對蛇說：「園中樹上的果子，我們可以吃，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["惟有園當中那棵樹上的果子，上帝曾說：『你們不可吃，也不可摸，免得你們死。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["蛇對女人說：「你們不一定死；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因為上帝知道，你們吃的日子眼睛就明亮了，你們便如上帝能知道善惡。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["於是女人見那棵樹的果子好作食物，也悅人的眼目，且是可喜愛的，能使人有智慧，就摘下果子來吃了，又給她丈夫，她丈夫也吃了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他們二人的眼睛就明亮了，才知道自己是赤身露體，便拿無花果樹的葉子為自己編做裙子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["天起了涼風，耶和華上帝在園中行走。那人和他妻子聽見上帝的聲音，就藏在園裏的樹木中，躲避耶和華上帝的面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華上帝呼喚那人，對他說：「你在哪裏？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他說：「我在園中聽見你的聲音，我就害怕；因為我赤身露體，我便藏了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和華說：「誰告訴你赤身露體呢？莫非你吃了我吩咐你不可吃的那樹上的果子嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["那人說：「你所賜給我、與我同居的女人，她把那樹上的果子給我，我就吃了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["耶和華上帝對女人說：「你做的是甚麼事呢？」女人說：「那蛇引誘我，我就吃了。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝的宣判"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和華上帝對蛇說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你既做了這事，就必受咒詛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比一切的牲畜野獸更甚；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必用肚子行走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"終身吃土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我又要叫你和女人彼此為仇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的後裔和女人的後裔也彼此為仇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"女人的後裔要傷你的頭；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要傷他的腳跟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又對女人說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必多多加增你懷胎的苦楚；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你生產兒女必多受苦楚。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必戀慕你丈夫；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你丈夫必管轄你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又對亞當說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你既聽從妻子的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃了我所吩咐你不可吃的那樹上的果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地必為你的緣故受咒詛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必終身勞苦才能從地裏得吃的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地必給你長出荊棘和蒺藜來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也要吃田間的菜蔬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必汗流滿面才得糊口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到你歸了土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你是從土而出的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你本是塵土，仍要歸於塵土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["亞當給他妻子起名叫夏娃，因為她是眾生之母。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和華上帝為亞當和他妻子用皮子做衣服給他們穿。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["亞當和夏娃被趕出伊甸園"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["耶和華上帝說：「那人已經與我們相似，能知道善惡；現在恐怕他伸手又摘生命樹的果子吃，就永遠活着。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["耶和華上帝便打發他出伊甸園去，耕種他所自出之土。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["於是把他趕出去了；又在伊甸園的東邊安設基路伯和四面轉動發火焰的劍，要把守生命樹的道路。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}